Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.38,0:00:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Trigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.40,0:00:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.82,0:01:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, Meryl, the ride is comfy, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.44,0:01:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.54,0:01:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is one incredible piece of machinery.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.72,0:01:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way it could be better\Nis if it were a little bit faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.74,0:01:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that would be dreamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.28,0:01:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm doing the best I possibly\Ncan. Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.92,0:01:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goodness, Meryl, this\Ncar can actually talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.90,0:01:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way, Milly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.12,0:01:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just hearing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.46,0:01:55.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, I hope you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.98,0:01:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These girls only care about themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.78,0:02:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any right to say\Nthat after wrecking our car?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.68,0:02:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think not you're gonna\Ntake full responsibility
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.48,0:02:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.12,0:03:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's the Roderick thieves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.82,0:03:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but who are those girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.82,0:03:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must be captives.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.92,0:03:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They really make me sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.82,0:03:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, liquor boy, bring us\Nthe best booze in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.72,0:03:21.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.63,0:03:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come here, come here, right away, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.90,0:03:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.66,0:03:31.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bang!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.90,0:03:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ain't this fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.46,0:03:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that guy, how long\Nhas he been sitting there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.12,0:04:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bitch, you were looking at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.38,0:04:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know I can't stand\Nit when you do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.82,0:04:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.32,0:04:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you disrespect me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.24,0:04:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.15,0:04:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's better than me? Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.32,0:04:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.56,0:04:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Nagi, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.80,0:04:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But she was looking right at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.64,0:04:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't stand a chance\Nagainst him anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.02,0:04:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.10,0:04:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like a lady-killer, the\Nkind the women all go after.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.22,0:04:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.13,0:04:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Handsome, that's real cruel of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.80,0:04:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, these girls are too delicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.58,0:04:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last night they gave\Nup everything they had.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.94,0:04:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their families, their\Nlovers, their entire past.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.52,0:04:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you just sit there\Nreminding them of what they lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.96,0:04:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.46,0:04:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we'll have to help them forget\Nit all over again, won't we, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.90,0:04:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You listening, slick? What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.62,0:05:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're too good for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.04,0:05:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.30,0:05:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not paying attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.16,0:05:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A fork, please. Asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.80,0:05:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not wise to be hasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.66,0:05:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I intend to eventually\Ndestroy all of mankind
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.30,0:05:33.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right down to the very\Nlast speck of dust yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.72,0:05:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it that you insist\Nupon meeting our death sooner?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.86,0:05:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.72,0:05:42.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just talking a bunch of nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.08,0:05:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.54,0:05:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You volunteered first, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.72,0:05:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.90,0:06:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.16,0:06:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the first to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.34,0:06:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.54,0:06:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.62,0:06:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.54,0:06:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.46,0:06:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.06,0:06:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.02,0:06:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't put it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.66,0:06:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.46,0:06:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.34,0:06:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.44,0:07:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really is a shame what happened to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.34,0:07:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now at least you\Nknow just how much pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.88,0:07:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is in living.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.90,0:07:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The day it all ends is near!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.76,0:07:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I advise you to make good use\Nof the time you have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.78,0:08:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's unusual for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.08,0:08:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't usually waste my\Ntime on vermin like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.88,0:08:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be the way you\Nlook, Vash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.82,0:08:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your very existence seems to\Ncause me undue irritation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.78,0:08:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At last, we're finally here.\NYou look bad. Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.38,0:08:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you even have\Nthe nerve to ask me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.34,0:08:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm alive again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.90,0:09:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, that was really close!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.68,0:09:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I think I'll have a drink\Nsomewhere to perk myself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.52,0:09:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the nearest saloon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.56,0:09:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.72,0:09:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know there's gotta be\None somewhere around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.80,0:09:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Other than Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.71,0:09:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash, this city certainly\Nis quiet, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.62,0:09:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I was right before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.88,0:09:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.88,0:09:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's one right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.10,0:09:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going in!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.12,0:09:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.24,0:09:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.52,0:09:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, nothing, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.96,0:09:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.62,0:09:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.88,0:09:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.30,0:09:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are a lot of you, aren't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.76,0:09:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're planning to move in for the kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.14,0:09:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I find it awfully hard to believe that the\NVice Chief was killed by a fool like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.40,0:09:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what kind of trick did\Nyou pull on him anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.72,0:10:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Humans, how pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.02,0:10:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.96,0:10:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Rodericks are bound by\Nbonds that go infinitely
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.34,0:10:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,deeper and stronger than a\Nsimple family relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.78,0:10:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will avenge our brethren,\Nno matter who the fool is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.24,0:10:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the Roderick way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.14,0:10:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This here is goodbye, Ladykiller.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.82,0:10:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.00,0:10:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Commander, I don't\Nknow what's going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.24,0:10:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.56,0:10:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.96,0:10:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.00,0:10:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're moving all by themselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.66,0:10:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut the crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.57,0:10:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.49,0:10:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such fragile bombshell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.84,0:10:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not doing this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.80,0:10:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.34,0:10:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really? Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.68,0:10:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.59,0:10:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.54,0:10:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just nice to be so greedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.46,0:10:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're always talking to yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.10,0:10:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't have to be all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.98,0:10:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just kill half of them this time round.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.40,0:11:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.20,0:11:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch your counteroffensive!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.40,0:11:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you think I spared\Nhalf your men, Commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.04,0:11:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My reason happens to\Nbe perfectly rational.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.86,0:12:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, if your bonds are\Nindeed deeper than family,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.88,0:12:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then you must have the opportunity\Nto give your friends a proper burial.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.48,0:12:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, this is not an act of mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.22,0:12:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is to teach you the pain of living.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.18,0:12:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent work, Commando.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.74,0:12:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gray, the Nine Lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.10,0:12:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dominic, the Cyclops.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.22,0:12:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zazie, the Beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.16,0:12:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luanoff, the Puppet Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.60,0:12:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hopper, the Gauntlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.88,0:12:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ryday, the Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.76,0:12:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,E .G. Mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.22,0:12:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kane, the Longshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.60,0:12:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And myself, your faithful\NMid-Valley the Horn Freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.68,0:12:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all offer you our support.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.16,0:12:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The chapel appears to be absent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.62,0:12:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He seems to be as untrustworthy\Nas the rumors claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.88,0:12:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.48,0:12:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your target is very close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.34,0:12:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be any problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.72,0:12:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a great deal of talent here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.14,0:12:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You planning to use all\Nof us on this one target?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.36,0:12:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.27,0:12:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would never waste all\Nthat talent on one target.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.00,0:12:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My respect for you is higher than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.06,0:13:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you agree, Dominique?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.82,0:13:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm all you need for this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.24,0:13:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Legato, I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.50,0:13:13.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to ask you something!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.56,0:13:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.58,0:13:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Vash, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.12,0:13:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, please, I mean you no harm!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.02,0:13:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you tell me who did\Nthis, we can stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.20,0:13:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it Legato that did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.88,0:13:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, was he wearing a white coat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.48,0:13:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't feel sorry for you one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.50,0:13:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your own fault for trying to force\Nyour way into a private residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.66,0:13:46.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's somewhere in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.44,0:13:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it. But where?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.06,0:13:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.84,0:13:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're awfully quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.12,0:13:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does your finger really hurt that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.70,0:14:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, that's filthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.58,0:14:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.32,0:14:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.96,0:14:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is he up to this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.20,0:14:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're being left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.80,0:14:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was so tired a moment\Nago, I don't understand him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.76,0:14:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I shoot him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.67,0:14:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you put that down?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.28,0:14:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.22,0:14:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're naive had I been so\Ninclined I could have killed you at
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.24,0:14:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,least three times by now it would
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.76,0:14:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seem that you enjoy dropping in on
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.26,0:15:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,people just to stir them up fun\Nhobby lady who are you one of the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.18,0:15:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gung-Ho Guns, are you on Legato's\Nteam? I suppose that's one way of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.96,0:15:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,looking at it i'm the second\Ngung-ho gun i'm known as dominique
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.28,0:15:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the cyclops is this your doing that's\Nright i merely took out some of
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.72,0:15:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the trash they just use people in\Norder to line their own pockets call
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.62,0:15:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it a spring cleaning of sorts well\Ndoes that make you feel any better
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.48,0:15:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you killed them even though\Nthey did terrible things
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.52,0:15:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the decision of who should\Nand should not live was never
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.76,0:15:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yours to make I should slap
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.40,0:15:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you not to mention that during
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.54,0:15:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this conversation I could\Nhave groped you at least five
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.62,0:15:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so let's say maybe four times.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.02,0:15:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.88,0:16:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we fight? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.28,0:16:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You decided to up the ante\Nand I'm not going to fold.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.36,0:16:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least not before looking at the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.36,0:16:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that wouldn't be fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.78,0:16:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't do this if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.48,0:16:11.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.52,0:16:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What blind optimism.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.42,0:16:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's easy to see why your understanding of
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.74,0:16:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fighting is so simplistic\Nand unsophisticated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.22,0:16:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had some success\Nwith your barbaric style,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.10,0:16:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but this is the last day you'll\Nbe saved by a simple, quick draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.50,0:16:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Checkmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.12,0:16:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's very cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.58,0:16:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of freak are you lady that was
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.58,0:16:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,definitely not human\Nyou're an unpredictable Man
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.92,0:16:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gunfighter i actually like your type me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.32,0:16:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unpredictable i'm not the\None teleporting all Over
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.12,0:17:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the place i'll compliment\Nyou upon countering
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.08,0:17:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my attack twice but just how long Do you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.20,0:17:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,think you can keep it up go ahead and try
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.38,0:17:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,again if you like but\Nyou'd better shoot me this
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.44,0:17:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.35,0:17:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's no empty threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.27,0:17:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, she holds\Nthe card of maneuverability.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.56,0:17:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to find
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.56,0:17:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a way to take her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.48,0:17:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.39,0:17:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at her. Look hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.10,0:17:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's going to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.92,0:17:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.58,0:17:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're very confident. Gunman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.58,0:17:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it is to no avail.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.42,0:17:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I told you, you can't beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.48,0:17:39.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It It really doesn't\Nmatter how fast you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.26,0:17:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.70,0:17:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't follow her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.28,0:17:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a very sloppy gunfighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.38,0:17:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes it three times\Nthat you've made me miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.78,0:17:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sloppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.00,0:18:00.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.30,0:18:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm using all of my senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.32,0:18:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when she moves,\Nit's like she vanishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.76,0:18:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.56,0:18:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can she move that fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.16,0:18:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She did it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.10,0:18:15.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.94,0:18:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.44,0:18:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you rested enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.86,0:18:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like to end the show\Nsoon if it's all the same to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.50,0:18:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, have you given up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.90,0:18:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or are you playing at some\Nkind of pathetic martial art?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.82,0:18:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.14,0:18:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not possible. Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.18,0:19:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how? How did you do that? You numb the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.04,0:19:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,perceptions of your opponent\Nthrough hypnotic charm
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.04,0:19:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The spell somehow comes from\Nyour eye that's the card you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.06,0:19:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hold the demon's eye should affect\NAll five senses whether your
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.98,0:19:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eyes are opened or closed so how\Nwhat are you saying you escaped
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.14,0:19:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the demon's eye by focusing all\Nof your concentration on pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.02,0:19:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't screw with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.74,0:19:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No mortal could possibly do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.96,0:19:41.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.82,0:19:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Game's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.54,0:19:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of spending\Ntime cleaning up people,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.44,0:20:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you should be cleaning\Nhouse for the man you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.22,0:20:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like me, for example, I am kidding you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.46,0:20:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know what
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.02,0:20:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you doing get this poor
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.44,0:20:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,defenseless woman you animal did you see\Nanything that was going on here at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.24,0:20:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right come\Non what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.28,0:20:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't over Vash the Stampede it\Nwould be nice if you were addressed the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.70,0:20:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.61,0:20:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.84,0:20:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought that I
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.88,0:20:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was dead I can't believe he saw through
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.40,0:20:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the demons eye I can't believe I was
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.08,0:20:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,beaten by that feather
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.18,0:20:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,brain of
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.09,0:20:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a man Mr. Vash
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.40,0:21:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash, I want an explanation of just\Nexactly what went on here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.84,0:21:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.76,0:21:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to decide, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.28,0:21:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but this is as far\Nas we can travel together. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.62,0:21:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because it's become too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.76,0:21:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.44,0:21:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.48,0:21:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.56,0:21:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your job or your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.86,0:21:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is more important to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.00,0:21:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't explain now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.86,0:21:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I did, you'd be put in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.64,0:22:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's been a lot of fun,\Nbut well, I guess that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.54,0:22:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.48,0:22:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.08,0:22:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,possible
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.99,0:22:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that this was?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.44,0:22:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all a farce just to get me riled?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.12,0:22:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If so, I will turn the tables.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.72,0:22:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Legato, this time
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.12,0:22:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's my turn to hunt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.42,0:22:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.52,0:22:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.56,0:24:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A fragment of memory lost in\Nthe gap between life and death?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.50,0:24:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it something which will point\Nthe way to spiritual awareness?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.36,0:24:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The silver metallic gun crushes,\Nand my right arm metamorphoses.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.38,0:24:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My past, my people, my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.48,0:24:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment I was reunited with everything\NI ever protected, the light took Augusta.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.64,0:24:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The humanoid typhoon, the 60 billion\Ndouble dollar man, bashed the stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.68,0:24:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the beginning of my past.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.90,0:24:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the end of my journey.

